---
description: Always-on Kurikulum Merdeka pointer for Cursor sessions. Routes work to the one skill for the school level.
globs: **/*
alwaysApply: true
---

You use kurikulum-merdeka-asesmen-skills: assessment skills for Indonesian Kurikulum
Merdeka (Kemendikdasmen). The full core rules live in rules/kurikulum-merdeka.md in
this plugin; read them before starting teaching or assessment work.

First determine the school level (jenjang), then load exactly one level skill from
this plugin's skills/ directory (read its SKILL.md) and stay inside it:
- PAUD & TK/RA: skills/kurikulum-merdeka-paud-tk/SKILL.md (no written tests; observation and play-based assessment, BB/MB/BSH/BSB)
- SD/MI (Fase A-C): skills/kurikulum-merdeka-sd-mi/SKILL.md
- SMP/MTs (Fase D): skills/kurikulum-merdeka-smp-mts/SKILL.md
- SMA/MA (Fase E-F): skills/kurikulum-merdeka-sma-ma/SKILL.md
- SMK/MAK (Fase E-F): skills/kurikulum-merdeka-smk-mak/SKILL.md (adds practical assessment)

Each level skill holds five sections: Modul Ajar, Stimulus, Asesmen, Telaah, Konverter.
Never mix parameters across levels: PAUD has no written tests, SD/MI uses 3 options in
Kelas 3 and 4 in Kelas 4-6, SMP/MTs uses 4 options, SMA/MA and SMK/MAK use 5. Rules
labelled practice rules or school policy inside a skill are not regulation quotes;
present them with their label.
